Cell["\<\
How many gates does that leave? On the seven-qubit code, all of them \
\[LongDash] every one of the twenty-four one-qubit Cliffords is a valid \
gadget, which is what the chapter singles this code out for. On the \
five-qubit code, exactly half:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7d6c313b-6800-4a9b-2b13-a96509b518e1"],

